5. AI HEALTHCARE NAVIGATION
Implement a guided workflow:

User describes a health concern
→ Extract relevant symptoms and context
→ Check emergency warning signs using deterministic safety rules
→ Ask relevant follow-up questions
→ Suggest an appropriate next step
→ Offer suitable doctors or other support
→ Display explanations and limitations.

Important rules:

Emergency warning signs must take priority over normal recommendations.

Never delay emergency guidance to complete a questionnaire or search for a provider.

AI-generated explanations must not override safety rules.

Do not make definitive diagnoses or automatically prescribe medication.

When uncertain, advise appropriate professional assessment.

Record only necessary information and obtain consent before storing it.

